Ops, 11 Oct 13:42Z, from the live logs:
- „[GET /members/:id] operator does not exist: text = integer":
  user_profile_kv.user_id is TEXT, read as $1::int. Now $1::text with the
  id as a string. Every member card answered 500 since 0138.
- „DELETE FROM conversations WHERE id = ANY($1::int[]) :: uuid = integer":
  conversations.id is a UUID. dropPlanStepsTheReplyCarries has removed no
  plan step since 9 Oct (it is best-effort, so nothing surfaced); now
  $1::uuid[], the ids read as strings.

A test pins both casts to the column types.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
